{"build":"6c7a310@16/11/2026, 18:43:24","data":{"book":{"title":"Gaudija Gītandžalī","subtitle":"Vaišnavu dziesmas un lūgšanas","slug":"lv","sort_order":5,"songsCount":91},"descriptions":[{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},{"title":"Гаудия Гитанджали","subtitle":"Cборник вайшнавских песен и молитв","slug":"ru","sort_order":2,"render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":3},"songsCount":178},{"title":"Guía de Kīrtan","subtitle":"Edición Detallada. Con traducción palabra por palabra y explicación de estilo","slug":"es","sort_order":3,"songsCount":146},{"title":"Livro de Kirtan","subtitle":"Seva Ashram, Campos do Jordão","slug":"pt","language":"pt-BR","sort_order":4,"songsCount":112},{"title":"Gaudija Gītandžalī","subtitle":"Vaišnavu dziesmas un lūgšanas","slug":"lv","sort_order":5,"songsCount":91},{"title":"Ґаудія Ґітанджалі","subtitle":"Вайшнавський пісенник українскою мовою","slug":"ua","sort_order":6,"language":"uk","render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":4},"songsCount":71},{"title":"Pocket Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Nabadwip, 2013","slug":"en-pe","language":"en","sort_order":7,"songsCount":80},{"title":"Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Chiang Mai English Edition, 2022","slug":"en-2022","sort_order":8,"hidden":true,"songsCount":166}],"nav":{"146":{"prev":{"path":"/lv/ki-rupe-paibo-seva-mui-durachara/","title":"Ki-rūpe pāibo sevā"},"next":{"path":"/lv/manasa-deho-geho-jo-kichu-mora/","title":"Mānasa Deho Geho"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":146,"first_line":"bhajahu̐ re mana śrī-nanda-nandana","author":"Śrīla Govinda Dās Kavirāj"},"title":["Bhajahu̐ Re Mana"],"author":["Šrīla Govinda Dāsa Kavirādžs"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["bhajahu̐ re mana    śrī-nanda-nandana","    abhaya-charaṇāravinda re","dūrlabha mānava    janama sat-saṅge","    taroho e bhava-sindhu re"],"translation":["Mans prāts, vienkārši pielūdz lotosam līdzīgās Nandas dēla pēdas, kuras dāvā cilvēkam bezbailību! Saņēmis tik reto dzimšanu cilvēka ķermenī, jel saskaries ar svētajiem un tu šķērsosi materiālās esības bezdibeni."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["śīta ātapa    bāta bariṣaṇa","    e dina jāminī jāgi re","biphale sevinu    kṛpaṇa durajana","    chapala sukha-laba lāgi’ re"],"translation":["Dienu un nakti, nezinot mieru, es ciešu karstumā un aukstumā, vējā un lietū. Iedomātas laimes kripatiņas dēļ es bezjēdzīgi kalpoju netikumīgiem un skopiem cilvēkiem."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["e dhana, jauvana,    putra, parijana","    ithe ki āche paratīti re","kamala-dala-jala,    jīvana ṭalamala","    bhajahu̐ hari-pada niti re"],"translation":["Kā gan var cerēt, ka materiālā labklājība, jaunība, bērni un citi tuvinieki sniegs patiesu laimi? Šī dzīve ir tik nepastāvīga kā ūdens piliens uz lotosa ziedlapas. Tāpēc vienmēr kalpo un pielūdz Kunga Harī dievišķās pēdas!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["śravaṇa, kīrtana,    smaraṇa, vandana,","    pāda-sevana, dāsya re","pūjana, sakhī-jana,    ātma-nivedana","    govinda-dāsa-abhilāṣa re"],"translation":["Govinda Dāsa lielākais sapnis un vēlme ir veltīt sevi deviņiem bhakti-jogas veidiem: klausīties par Kunga Harī slavu, dziedāt un stāstīt citiem par šo slavu, pastāvīgi atcerēties Kungu un piedāvāt Viņam lūgšanas, kalpot Viņa lotosam līdzīgajām pēdām, veltīt sevi Kungam kalpa lomā, pielūgt Viņu ar ziediem, vīraku un citām veltēm, kalpot Kungam drauga lomā un pilnībā  atdot sevi Kunga rokās."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-bhajahu-re-1","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-bhajahu-re","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.K. Ashram Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/scsmathcolombia/13-bhajahu-re-mana","personSlug":"srila-b-k-ashram-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/bhajahu-re-mana","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Bhakti Lalita Devi","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bhakti-lalita-devi/bhakti-lalita-devi-bhajahu-re-mana","personSlug":"bhakti-lalita-devi"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-bxadzhaxu-re","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Bhajahu-Re-Mana-07-05"},"head":{"canonical":"/lv/bhajahu-re-mana-shri-nanda-nandana/","description":"Bhajahu̐ Re Mana — vaišnavu dziesma ar vārdiem, tulkojumu latviešu valodā un skaidrojumu vārdu pa vārdam. Autors — Śrīla Govinda Dās Kavirāj. No grāmatas «Gaudija Gītandžalī».","title":"Bhajahu̐ Re Mana. Šrīla Govinda Dāsa Kavirādžs | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"lv","slug":"bhajahu-re-mana-shri-nanda-nandana"}}